      "seconds": 4.0
    },
    {
      "id": "NCM01-S04",
      "text": "先别急，我看一下。等它过去，好，现在走。",
      "sha256": "8a5f2aecfb30ceea6ad38416ca5b3226e5dd1af7cd85d0e78e1ef3e31cb7f8ee",
      "seconds": 4.08
    },
    {
      "id": "NCM01-S05",
      "text": "没关系啦，输一局也没什么。休息一下，我们再来。",
      "sha256": "5b44193e41e1730ae7822a4f056d0b941f898e2e638dfc7775a57a05d4f25e2e",
      "seconds": 5.0
    },
    {
